1174x - 1224 - 3921x &= -227 \\
-2747x &= -347 \\
x &= \frac{347}{2747}
\end{align*}

Now substitute $x$ back into the expressions for $y$ and $z$:
\begin{align*}
y &= \frac{-32 - 31\left(\frac{347}{2747}\right)}{28} \\
y &= -16 \\
z &= \frac{9 + 4(-16)}{31} \\
